cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below."
title: "Steam Video Game Network: a bipartite analysis of games and gameplay tags"
abstract: >-
  A bipartite network analysis of the 100 most-played Steam games and their
  126 gameplay tags (SteamSpy, May 2026), projected into a game network and a
  tag co-occurrence network and analysed with structural statistics, Louvain
  communities, centrality and disparity-filter backbones in an R Shiny app.
type: software
authors:
